{
 "_README": [
  "MASTER TEMPLATE. Never edit this file. Copy per brand as <brand>-page-config.json.",
  "",
  "EVERY key is null. That is deliberate. A template pre-filled with one brand's",
  "values is not a template, it is that brand's config wearing a template's name,",
  "and any field left unfilled ships the wrong brand's data onto a live page.",
  "The previous version of this file shipped a live review-widget API key and",
  "another company's patent number to every brand that copied it.",
  "",
  "Validate before building:   python scripts/page_build.py check <your-config.json>",
  "Build a section:            python scripts/page_build.py render <section> <config>",
  "",
  "173 keys used by the section library.",
  "  brand_level (29): set once per brand.",
  "  page_copy   (150): written per asset. A listicle and an offer",
  "  page fill different subsets; `check` names exactly which ones your chosen",
  "  sections require."
 ],
